{"id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-congruence-lattice.md","title":"Congruence Lattice","display":"df-congruence-lattice — Congruence Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-congruence-lattice","aliases":["93-df-congruence-lattice"],"display":"df-congruence-lattice — Congruence Lattice","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-congruence-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-congruence-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-congruence-lattice — Congruence Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> is its congruence set.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> are the diagonal and universal congruences.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_{\\mathbf A},\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\wedge_{\\mathbf A},\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span>, the lattice reduct <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\\)</span>, and the bounded display <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConBLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConBLat}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(|\\mathbf A|^2)\">\\(\\mathcal P(|\\mathbf A|^2)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_{\\mathbf A},\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\wedge_{\\mathbf A},\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> 是下列图表示的二元运算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93},\\mathrm{ConBLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93},\\mathrm{ConBLat}_{93}\\)</span> 仅在代数上定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle,\\theta\\cap\\phi\\rangle:\n\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle,\\theta\\cap\\phi\\rangle:\n\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle,\n\\bigcap\\{\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\theta\\cup\\phi\\subseteq\\psi\\}\\rangle:\n\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle,\n\\bigcap\\{\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\theta\\cup\\phi\\subseteq\\psi\\}\\rangle:\n\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\wedge_{\\mathbf A}\\phi\\coloneqq\\wedge_{\\mathbf A}(\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\phi\\coloneqq\\vee_{\\mathbf A}(\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta\\wedge_{\\mathbf A}\\phi\\coloneqq\\wedge_{\\mathbf A}(\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\phi\\coloneqq\\vee_{\\mathbf A}(\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}\n\\qquad(R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}\n\\qquad(R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\\theta\\wedge_{\\mathbf A}\\phi=\\theta\\cap\\phi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\\theta\\wedge_{\\mathbf A}\\phi=\\theta\\cap\\phi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\phi=\\bigcap\\{\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\theta\\cup\\phi\\subseteq\\psi\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\phi=\\bigcap\\{\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\theta\\cup\\phi\\subseteq\\psi\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A),\\wedge_{\\mathbf A},\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A),\\wedge_{\\mathbf A},\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConBLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A),\\wedge_{\\mathbf A},\\vee_{\\mathbf A},\n\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConBLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A),\\wedge_{\\mathbf A},\\vee_{\\mathbf A},\n\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\\to\n\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\\to\n\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generated-congruence operator is the intersection of the nonempty family of congruences containing its input relation. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\\)</span> is exactly the three-component object consumed by the lattice predicates; the separate bounded display retains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congr